fixture safe_ground_never_in_crawl_gap
doc (movement review 4, M4) safe ground is never noted where a standing body does not fit: Ash crouches through tech 10's 32 u crawl gap, crouch-dashes out and walks into floor spikes past the exit. The send-back puts a standing Ash on the last ground with room to stand, before the gap; it used to put a standing 44 u body into the 32 u gap, stuck in its ceiling.
room test/crawl_gap_spikes
spawn 600 544
frames 120
input
  0..2 D
  3 D dash
  4..26 R
  27 D dash
  28..119 R
end
expect
  at 3 event.dash=1 crouch=1
  during 19..26 crouch=1 ground=1
  mark die 28..119 event.hazard=1
  # Sent back standing to ground with room to stand (x 600, before the gap), not into the 32 u
  # gap where a standing body would sit 12 u into its ceiling.
  at die height=44 ground=1 x=600u
  never die+1..119 event.hazard=1
end
